---
import ServicePageLayout from '../../../layouts/ServicePageLayout.astro';
import VanSection from '../../../components/VanSection.astro';
---

<ServicePageLayout
  title="HVAC Maintenance & System Inspection Services | HiLo Heating & Air"
  description="HiLo Heating & Air offers comprehensive HVAC maintenance services and system inspections to keep your home comfortable year-round. Serving Orange County with same-day scheduling and certified technicians. Book your HVAC inspection today!"
  heroTitle="HVAC Services in Stanton, CA"
  heroSubtitle="Your AC dies in July. Or your furnace decides to quit the one cold week of the year. That's us. Hilo Heating and Air has been working on heating and cooling systems around Stanton for years."
  faqKey="services-hvac"
  relatedServices={[
    { name: 'HVAC Installation', href: '/services/hvac-services/hvac-installation/', desc: 'Correctly sized, code-compliant new systems.' },
    { name: 'HVAC Replacement', href: '/services/hvac-services/hvac-replacement/', desc: 'Honest assessment when repair isn’t enough.' },
    { name: 'Emergency HVAC Repair', href: '/services/hvac-services/emergency-hvac-repair/', desc: '24/7 heating + cooling emergencies.' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="pt-4 sm:pt-8 pb-16 sm:pb-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-lg">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-brand-blue mt-0 mb-4">Complete HVAC Services in Stanton, CA</h2>

      <p>Your AC dies in July. Or your furnace decides to quit the one cold week of the year. It happens — and when it does, you want someone local who actually picks up the phone. That's us. Hilo Heating and Air has been working on heating and cooling systems around Stanton for years now, and most of our calls come from people who used us once and just kept calling.</p>
      <p>We're not trying to be everything to everyone. We do heating and cooling, we do it well, and we'd rather have a smaller list of happy customers than a long list of people who felt rushed or upsold. That's just how we run things.</p>

      <h2>What We Actually Do</h2>
      <p>Let's be honest — most people ignore their HVAC system until it breaks. But a little <strong>HVAC maintenance service</strong> now and then saves you from the big, expensive surprise later. We clean the coils, check refrigerant, look at the wiring, test the thermostat. Boring stuff. But boring stuff is what keeps a system running for fifteen years instead of eight. Skipping it doesn't save you money — it just delays the bill and makes it bigger.</p>
      <p>If something feels off but you can't quite name it, ask for an <strong>HVAC system inspection</strong>. We'll go through the airflow, the <a href="/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/hvac-duct-repair/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">ductwork</a>, the safety switches — basically the whole system — and tell you what's actually wrong, not just what sounds expensive. We've turned away plenty of "you need a new system" calls because, honestly, a $200 fix did the trick. An inspection is also smart if you're buying a house, selling one, or just haven't had anyone look at your unit in a couple years.</p>
      <p>When a system really is done, we do full <a href="/services/hvac-services/hvac-installation/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">new HVAC system installation</a> and <a href="/services/hvac-services/hvac-replacement/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">HVAC replacement</a> work too — sizing it right for your home, pulling the old unit, putting in the new one, and testing it before we pack up. Getting the size wrong is one of the most common mistakes in this industry, and it leads to higher bills and a system that struggles year-round. You shouldn't have to wonder if it's working, or whether you got the right unit for your space in the first place.</p>
      <p>Looking for specific help? See <a href="/services/air-conditioning-services/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">Air Conditioning</a> and <a href="/services/heating-services/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">Heating Services</a>, or <a href="/services/hvac-services/emergency-hvac-repair/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">Emergency HVAC Repair</a> when you cannot wait. We serve <a href="/service-areas/stanton/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">Stanton</a> and all <a href="/service-areas/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">service areas</a>.</p>
      <p class="text-sm bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 not-prose">Related reading: <a href="/blogs/hvac-replacement/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:text-brand-red">HVAC Replacement Guide</a> · <a href="/blogs/skipping-hvac-maintenance-costs-more/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:text-brand-red">Skipping Maintenance Costs More</a> · <a href="/blogs/seasonal-hvac-maintenance/" class="text-brand-blue font-semibold hover:text-brand-red">Seasonal HVAC Maintenance</a></p>

      <h2>How We Work</h2>
      <p>We try to keep things simple. You call, we ask a few questions, and we give you a real window for when we'll show up — not a vague "sometime this week." Before any work starts, you'll know what it costs. No add-ons sprung on you halfway through the job. If a repair makes more sense than a replacement, we'll say so, even if it means a smaller invoice for us.</p>

      <h2>Why People Stick With Us</h2>
      <p>Hilo Heating and Air isn't the biggest company in Orange County, and that's kind of the point. We show up, we're straight with you about pricing, and we don't vanish after the invoice. That's pretty much our whole pitch. Most of our work comes from referrals — neighbors telling neighbors — which says more about us than any ad ever could.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <VanSection 
    title="Our Service Fleet"
    subtitle="Professional HVAC vehicles ready to serve your home"
  />

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-8 text-center">Our HVAC Services</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        {[
          { title: 'HVAC Installation', desc: 'New HVAC system installation with proper sizing.', href: '/services/hvac-services/hvac-installation/' },
          { title: 'HVAC Replacement', desc: 'Honest assessments and quality system replacement.', href: '/services/hvac-services/hvac-replacement/' },
          { title: 'Air Balancing', desc: 'Fix uneven temperatures throughout your home.', href: '/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/hvac-air-balancing/' },
          { title: 'Duct Repair', desc: 'Professional duct repair and replacement.', href: '/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/hvac-duct-repair/' },
          { title: 'Duct Sealing', desc: 'Stop losing conditioned air through leaky ducts.', href: '/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/hvac-duct-sealing/' },
          { title: 'Humidifier Install', desc: 'Whole-home humidity control solutions.', href: '/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/air-humidifiers/' },
          { title: 'Duct Installation', desc: 'New ductwork for additions and replacements.', href: '/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/duct-installation/' },
          { title: 'Emergency HVAC', desc: '24/7 emergency heating and cooling repair.', href: '/services/hvac-services/emergency-hvac-repair/' },
        ].map((svc) => (
          <a href={svc.href} class="bg-white border border-brand-blue/10 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition-all group">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-blue mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">{svc.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">{svc.desc}</p>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              Learn More
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" /></svg>
            </span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ServicePageLayout>
